                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2486' id='110' type-v2='text' w='98814' x='593' y='9448'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#202442' fontsize='15'>What is data coverage?</run>
                      <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                      <format attr='background-color' value='#e6e6e6' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone forceUpdate='true' h='5707' id='111' type-v2='text' w='47833' x='593' y='11934'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Data Coverage:</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='10'>We define data coverage as the % of values of each specific variable that has non-null values (in the case of integers or numeric fields) or non-blanks values (in the case of the string fields). </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone forceUpdate='true' h='5707' id='117' type-v2='text' w='50981' x='48426' y='11934'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Coverage ranges from 0% to 100%, where the higher, the better:</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='10'>      - 0% would indicate an </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e03531' fontsize='10'>inexistent coverage </run>
                      <run fontsize='10'>of that datapoint, </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='10'>      - 50% would indicate a</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#ff9d9a' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ed8578' fontsize='10'>poor coverage</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#ff9d9a' fontsize='10'>,</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontsize='10'> and</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='10'>      - 100% an</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#6fdade' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#6fdade' fontsize='10'>excellent coverage</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontsize='10'>.</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone h='2445' id='123' type-v2='empty' w='98814' x='593' y='17641'>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone h='7448' id='244' is-centered='0' is-scaled='1' param='Image/DH_Fintech_Full_RGB.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='30594' x='68813' y='400'>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone h='5952' id='181' type-v2='empty' w='2378' x='97029' y='93648'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='5952' id='182' type-v2='text' w='96436' x='593' y='93648'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true'>Notes:</run>
                  <run>
- Coverage in percentage of card related related data points (eg. card hash, BIN, card holder name, etc.) is only calculated over the number of card transactions, excluding other payment methods for which this data is not available (eg. cash or payment on delivery).
- For 3DS related variables, coverage in percentage is calculated only over card transactions and in which de decision of the Anti-Fraud was Review (3DS triggered). This means that cases in which 3DS was not requested are excluding from the percentage calculation. </run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2500' id='124' type-v2='text' w='98815' x='296' y='17300'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#202442' fontsize='15'>Coverage Overview</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#e6e6e6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2500' id='136' type-v2='text' w='98815' x='370' y='49750'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#202442' fontsize='15'>Coverage evolution by </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#e03531' fontsize='15'>field</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
